# p_b2c8 — The entry is a permanent chaos zone; nothing gets sorted until Sunday

Yuki dumps her keys, laptop, notebook, water bottle, jacket, and backpack on the entry hook when she arrives at 17:30 and does not sort them for hours. Omar, when he leaves at 13:40, leaves his bike lock, helmet, and umbrella where they are. The entry stays cluttered all week. Only on Sunday evening (18:00–20:00) does someone do a quick tidy: laptop to desk_b1, water bottle to kitchen, jacket to wardrobe. On weekdays the laptop and notebook sit at entry_hook from 17:30 until 7:00 the next morning. Omar's tablet stays in chair_k1 (home entertainment). Yuki's work tools (laptop, notebook, pen, keys, wallet) go OUT_OF_HOUSE 8:00–17:30. No cycling on weekdays; weekend cycling 10:00–13:00. What sets this apart: the entry_hook is full of Yuki's things at 20:00 on a weekday evening. What would refute it: laptop_yuki sighted at desk_b1 on a weekday between 18:00 and 22:00, or the entry_hook being empty of Yuki's items at 20:00 on a Wednesday.

